Package: dock-lyrics
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: dde-shell (>= 2.0.0), libqt6network6, libqt6dbus6
Maintainer: song <song@deepin>
Homepage: https://github.com/song/dock-lyrics
Description: Lyrics boat - a dock widget showing current music lyrics
  A deepin (dde-shell) dock plugin that wakes up when a MPRIS compatible
  player starts playing, then shows the current lyric line as a gentle
  marquee right on the taskbar. Lyrics are read from a local .lrc file
  first, and fetched online (NetEase Cloud Music) as a fallback.
